                        <li>We may suspend or restrict an account, a project or a deployment if you break these terms, if your payment fails, or if a deployment threatens the security or stability of the platform. Suspended accounts cannot create new deployments.</li>
                        <li>Where it is reasonable and safe to do so, we will tell you why and give you a chance to fix the problem.</li>
                        <li>When an account ends, we may delete its projects and files after a reasonable period. Records we must keep by law, such as invoices and payment history, are retained as described in the Privacy Policy.</li>
